BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (that believed it ran 70 apps actually had 223, with 118 arriving through expense reports [ARjBgExQ3oQ @ 00:16:23].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Zylo's index adds that 37% of apps are bought by employees and expensed, and IT now buys only about 18% of) Tj ET
