BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Detail: Airtable sends yes-or-no access forms, AI judges each justification, weak answers go to admin review, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (denials are deactivated via API [Optimize Information Systems - tex2cNz4vcc @ 00:02:20]; reclaimed seats go to a) Tj ET
