BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (renewal on Friday with 600 licenses allowed and 802 in use, 801 of them real, and says 'I never do this manually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (anymore' [tex2cNz4vcc @ 00:01:56]. His Airtable build pulls user lists through integrations, scopes the audit to three) Tj ET
