BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (some vendors raising prices with no language at all, and repackaging that adds support fees or across-SKU increases a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (pre-negotiated cap does not touch; the fix is a 3 to 5% cap written to survive pricing-model changes, plus 90 days of) Tj ET
